      "cooked": "<p>Some of Ambuscade's Snare cards have wording along the lines of \"Put this card next to the Hero Character Card with the fewest HP\".&nbsp; A player in our group (whose Hero was incapacitated) argued that his Hero Character Card had \"the fewest HP\".&nbsp; I (thinking like a programmer) argued that there was difference between \"0\" and \"NULL\".&nbsp; Opinions?</p>",
